---
title: M08 Proposed authenticated remote read - no transport selected
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Typed caller
    participant Client as Peer adapter
    participant Edge as Destination edge
    participant Bridge as Existing bridge
    participant Read as Node capability
    Caller->>Client: AddressedCall target B, typed node.info, request Q, budget
    Note over Caller,Client: Configured peer identity, no caller URL. Caller supplied ID stays intact.
    Client->>Edge: Bounded frame, evidence, remaining timeout
    Note over Client,Edge: Authenticate intended peer. Do not refresh original budget.
    Note over Edge,Bridge: Verify identity, audience, target and bounds. Claims alone are not a Principal.
    Edge->>Edge: Versioned bounded decode, no business effects
    Edge->>Bridge: Same typed Envelope plus verified HostContext
    Bridge->>Bridge: Header route, admission, payload variant
    Bridge->>Read: Admitted typed request
    Read->>Read: Resource policy before observation
    Read-->>Bridge: Typed result or bounded error
    Bridge-->>Edge: Response preserves request and correlation
    Edge-->>Client: Authenticated responder and matching response
    Client->>Client: Verify target, incarnation, IDs, version and limits
    Client-->>Caller: Typed result
    Note over Caller,Client: Lost reply after possible send is OutcomeUnknown. No automatic failover or effectful retry.
    Note over Edge,Read: First remote surface is node reads only. Jobs and disk remain disabled remotely.
